review_comments:
I think you could keep this as is, avoid the new helpers, and just pass in an optional arg with the KeepAlive exception if set.
E.g.:
```
HeartBeatTimeout:
  lock
    _state = aborted;
    _exception = ex;
Operation:
  lock
    state = _state;
    innerEx = _exception;
  ThrowIfInvalid(state, innerEx);
```
